  "notes": "Callouts CAN_RX IO26 / CAN_TX IO27, RS485_RX IO21 / RS485_TX IO22, CAN_SE IO23, RS485_EN IO17 / RS485_SE IO19 and SD_* name MCU signals, not terminal pins; not transcribed as pins. Skipped the 5~12V power DC 2-position terminal (individual positions not legibly labeled), USB Type-C, BOOT and RESET buttons, WS2812 LED, microSD slot. Bottom-view silkscreen prints 'IO5' for the callout 'IO05'. Image 2 is the English version of image 1."
